&lt;h2 id="garden"&gt;Garden&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I.ix.9/10&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="garden-description"&gt;Garden Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To the rear of this house a raised garden (a), three steps up, had a &lt;em&gt;portico&lt;/em&gt; on the east. The &lt;em&gt;portico&lt;/em&gt; was supported by two columns on the east, an engaged column and a pilaster.&lt;/p&gt;
